    <string name="disclaimer_short">For education and personal tracking only. It does not replace your nephrologist or your dialysis team.</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_full">NephroCare helps you learn about kidney disease and keep your own records in order. It does not diagnose, it does not suggest or change any treatment, it never sets or changes medicine doses, it does not set your dry weight or the amount of fluid to remove during dialysis, and its food advice is general: your diet depends on your blood tests and your condition. Always follow the instructions of your nephrologist, dialysis nurses and dietitian. In an emergency, call for medical help immediately. The medical content must be reviewed by a nephrology specialist.</string>
